      "id": "claim_8edc0623f2724d6ca0e168ea1b8388d9",
      "statement": "celld runs pooled V8 isolates that belong to no thread (v8::Locker installs the entering thread's per-isolate state) under one multi-threaded Tokio runtime, with pool.rs owning handles and counters while every choice about which isolate, when to grow, what to shed, and what to retire is decided by the pure celld_logic::isolate module.",
